      "text": "{\n  \"sub\": \"user-123\",\n  \"iss\": \"https://auth.example.com\",\n  \"aud\": \"ecommerce-api\",\n  \"scope\": \"orders:read orders:write\",\n  \"exp\": 1793600000\n}\n\nField        Meaning\nsub        Subject — the user ID\niss        Issuer — who created the token\naud        Audience — which API/service the\ntoken is intended for\nscope        Permissions granted\nexp        Expiration time",
